        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127603-CixEdBk9ItUU.png"
        },
        "description": "__Race:__ Beastman\n__Species:__ Black Cat\n__Class:__ Swordlord\n\nFran is the main female protagonist of the Tensei Shitara Ken Deshita story. \n\nShe is normally stoic and expressionless, Fran can be quick to anger when her race is insulted and is almost completely unafraid of the idea of displaying violence and mercilessness for the sake of achieving her goals. She views most Blue Catkin with hostility due to their betrayal and selling of her people into slavery. Fran will express happiness or excitement at the prospects of fighting a strong opponent or eating curry. Anyone, that insults that which she takes pride in, will face her wrath. Fran does not completely understand metaphors and will take things literally.",
        "gender": "Female",
        "age": "12-13"
      },
      "voiceActors": [
        {
          "id": 113511,
          "name": {
            "full": "Ai Kakuma",
            "native": "加隈亜衣"
          },
          "image": {
            "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n113511-F58Tk4OFKs1w.jpg"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "role": "MAIN",
      "node": {
        "id": 137864,
        "name": {
          "full": "Shishou",
          "native": "師匠",
          "alternative": [
            "Master",
            "Teacher"
          ]
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b137864-p4UOJKVpNM4Z.png"
        },
        "description": "__Species:__ Intelligent Weapon\n\nMaster is the main protagonist of the Tensei Shitara Ken Deshita series and the main weapon of Fran.\n\nHis personality is that of a father/guardian of sorts towards Fran, he takes care and protects her while also assisting her by providing his abilities and bonuses to Fran. Towards other people Master acts in a kind and well mannered way, except if that people disrespect or try to hurt Fran in any way or shape.\n\nIn sword form, Master looks like a white longsword with three blue lines on it. Beneath the pale gold hilt there is the sculpture of a courageous wolf and a decorative blue string. The handle is wound with a latticework of blue and white strings.\n\nBefore being reincarnated into a sword, he appeared to be a 30-year old salary man who enjoyed anime, manga, VRMMOs, and light novels. He had a friendly personality, enjoyed eating curry, and had some level of proficiency in cooking but had never dated before. He is killed at the start of the story by an oblivious driver who was texting and driving.\n\n",
        "gender": "Male",
        "age": null
      },
      "voiceActors": [
        {
